Event Trigger <code>card.archived</code> Card archived via the Archive action <code>card.unarchived</code> Card restored from the archived panel <p><code>card.archived</code> payload — contains only the card ID (not the full card object):</p> <pre><code>{ "event": "card.archived", "data": { "card_id": 101 } }
</code></pre> <p><code>card.unarchived</code> payload — contains the full serialized card so the frontend can restore it to the board without an additional API call:</p> <pre><code>{ "event": "card.unarchived", "data": { "id": 101, "uid": "3a9f1c2d7e4b8a05", "title": "...", "archived_at": null, ... } }
</code></pre>
